        "detailed_description": "<h1>Play free Prologue!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1349680/extras/d423c7712a8c1c70131f1a3af49db4a1.avif?t=1759849293\" width=1150 height=364 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I’m <strong>Rookie</strong>, the new guy on the space courier ship <strong>BallEx</strong>. Life onboard was already chaotic, but after crashing on a hostile planet, it’s up to me to recover the lost cargo and the parts we need to get the ship flying again… assuming the crew doesn’t drive me insane first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1349680/extras/be0a3ad4f981bfb530fb7f5d082fc0de.avif?t=1759849293\" width=1150 height=364 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At least I’m not completely alone. <strong>H.A.P.P.Y.</strong>, the ship’s over-eager AI, insists on tagging along. With its “help,” I shift tetrominos to reshape the terrain, blast enemies when things get hairy, and puzzle my way through whatever obstacles this planet throws at me.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, I stumble across eccentric crewmates and passengers, uncover secrets best left buried, and try to keep what’s left of my sanity. The game is turn-based, which gives me time to plan every move… though if I overthink it, I’ll probably just dig myself into a hole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1349680/extras/7caf910cd651e4b21270341e5422649f.avif?t=1759849293\" width=1176 height=585 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The adventure unfolds chapter by chapter, each one packed with new puzzles, hazards, and plenty of questionable life choices. <strong>Chapter 1</strong> is just the beginning — and trust me, the crew has more ways to ruin my day than this planet ever could.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1349680/extras/storepage_footer?t=1759849293\" /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1349680/extras/d423c7712a8c1c70131f1a3af49db4a1.avif?t=1759849293\" width=1150 height=364 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I’m <strong>Rookie</strong>, the new guy on the space courier ship <strong>BallEx</strong>. Life onboard was already chaotic, but after crashing on a hostile planet, it’s up to me to recover the lost cargo and the parts we need to get the ship flying again… assuming the crew doesn’t drive me insane first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1349680/extras/be0a3ad4f981bfb530fb7f5d082fc0de.avif?t=1759849293\" width=1150 height=364 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At least I’m not completely alone. <strong>H.A.P.P.Y.</strong>, the ship’s over-eager AI, insists on tagging along. With its “help,” I shift tetrominos to reshape the terrain, blast enemies when things get hairy, and puzzle my way through whatever obstacles this planet throws at me.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, I stumble across eccentric crewmates and passengers, uncover secrets best left buried, and try to keep what’s left of my sanity. The game is turn-based, which gives me time to plan every move… though if I overthink it, I’ll probably just dig myself into a hole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1349680/extras/7caf910cd651e4b21270341e5422649f.avif?t=1759849293\" width=1176 height=585 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The adventure unfolds chapter by chapter, each one packed with new puzzles, hazards, and plenty of questionable life choices. <strong>Chapter 1</strong> is just the beginning — and trust me, the crew has more ways to ruin my day than this planet ever could.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1349680/extras/storepage_footer?t=1759849293\" /></span></p>",
        "short_description": "Move tetrominos to shape the terrain, blast enemies, and survive a chaotic crew with your over-eager ship AI, H.A.P.P.Y., on a hostile, mysterious planet.",
        "supported_languages": "English",
        "reviews": "“Tetris and turn-based tactics does seem like an odd mix, but it works surprisingly well and it makes for a very addictive and unique gameplay experience. The pixel art animation is excellent and the game has a lot of charm and a delightful sense of humor. A quirky blocky adventure well worth embarking on.”<br>Alpha Beta Gamer<br>",
